<title>HUNGARY: Hungary jobless rate falls to 10.5 pct in December.</title>
<headline>Hungary jobless rate falls to 10.5 pct in December.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's unemployment rate fell to 10.5 percent in December from 10.6 percent in November, the National Labor Centre (OMK) said on Monday.</p>
<p>    HUNGARY JOBLESS	   Dec 96    Nov 96   Dec 95</p>
<p>    registered unemployed   477,500   484,500  495,893</p>
<p>    rate (pct)		   10.5	10.6     10.4</p>
<p>NOTE - All percentage figures are based on the size of the active population in January 1995.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
